     H***TEXT:Customer maintenance
     H*
     H* CM001  - CUSTOMER MAINTENANCE                   DKOWALSKI  03/04/98
     H* ENTER RETRIEVES, F6 UPDATES OR ADDS, F12 CLEARS.
     H*
     FCM001DF CF  E                    WORKSTN
     FCUSTMASTUF  E           K        DISK                      A
     E                    MSG     1  10 50
     IKEYDS       DS
     I                                        1   60CUST#
     C           *IN03     DOWEQ'0'
     C                     EXFMTCM001R1
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SMSG
     C           *IN03     IFEQ '0'
     C           *IN12     IFEQ '1'
     C                     EXSR RESET
     C                     ELSE
     C           *IN06     IFEQ '1'
     C                     EXSR SAVE
     C                     ELSE
     C                     EXSR GET
     C                     END
     C                     END
     C                     END
     C                     END
     C                     SETON                     LR
     C                     RETRN
     C           GET       BEGSR
     C                     Z-ADDSCUST     CUST#
     C           CUST#     CHAINCUSTMAST             90
     C           *IN90     IFEQ '1'
     C                     MOVE MSG,1     SMSG
     C                     ELSE
     C                     MOVE CNAME     SNAME
     C                     MOVE CADDR     SADDR
     C                     MOVE CCITY     SCITY
     C                     MOVE CSTATE    SSTATE
     C                     Z-ADDCROUTE    SROUTE
     C                     Z-ADDCSTOP     SSTOP
     C                     MOVE PCLASS    SPCLAS
     C                     END
     C                     ENDSR
     C           SAVE      BEGSR
     C                     Z-ADDSCUST     CUST#
     C           CUST#     CHAINCUSTMAST             90
     C                     Z-ADDSCUST     CUSTNO
     C                     MOVE SNAME     CNAME
     C                     MOVE SADDR     CADDR
     C                     MOVE SCITY     CCITY
     C                     MOVE SSTATE    CSTATE
     C                     Z-ADDSROUTE    CROUTE
     C                     Z-ADDSSTOP     CSTOP
     C                     MOVE SPCLAS    PCLASS
     C           *IN90     IFEQ '1'
     C                     MOVE 'YNYNYNN' DLVDAY
     C                     MOVE 'A'       CSTAT
     C                     WRITECUSTMASR
     C                     MOVE MSG,10    SMSG
     C                     ELSE
     C                     UPDATCUSTMASR
     C                     MOVE MSG,9     SMSG
     C                     END
     C                     ENDSR
     C           RESET     BEGSR
     C                     Z-ADD0         SCUST
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SNAME
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SADDR
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SCITY
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SSTATE
     C                     Z-ADD0         SROUTE
     C                     Z-ADD0         SSTOP
     C                     MOVE ' '       SPCLAS
     C                     ENDSR
**
CUSTOMER NOT FOUND                                
ITEM NOT FOUND                                    
LINE ADDED - ENTER NEXT ITEM OR F3 TO EXIT        
ORDER CANCELLED                                   
ENTER QUANTITY                                    
ITEM NOT PRICED                                   
WEIGHT RECORDED                                   
ORDER LINE NOT FOUND                              
CUSTOMER UPDATED                                  
CUSTOMER ADDED                                    
